              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eRelease a full basket, or void an empty one \u0026ndash; from the same \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLot Management\u003c/span\u003e tab you use to open one. Every cavity of the die is listed there, whether or not it is holding a basket.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#093240;border-left:5px solid #22A8CC;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;margin:4px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;padding-bottom:4px;\"\u003eYou do not have to reconcile the shift first\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eReleasing asks you for the press counter reading and credits that cavity everything it is owed up to that reading. Settle the rest of the die on \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eReconcile Shift\u003c/span\u003e at the end of the shift as usual \u0026ndash; the cavity you just released is picked up from where it left off, so nothing is counted twice and nothing is lost.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003ePress Release on the basket\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe row names the cavity, its ticket and what is on it now.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eEnter the press counter reading\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eType the number showing on the press counter into \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ePress counter reading now\u003c/span\u003e. If you swapped the basket at the machine and came to the terminal later, use the number you wrote down at the swap, not the number showing now.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCheck the three boxes\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThey read \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eon the basket now + this release adds \u003d basket closes at\u003c/span\u003e. The middle number is the reading you typed minus what this cavity has already been credited \u0026ndash; the subtraction is done for you and shown to you.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe line underneath names that number: \"This cavity is already credited through counter 1,450. The system subtracts it \u0026ndash; you never do.\"\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eRelease it\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eRelease basket\u003c/span\u003e. The basket leaves the cavity, moves on to its next step, and the cavity is free for a new one.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"border-top:1px solid #172238;margin:2px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eTHE OTHER THINGS ON THIS TAB\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eVoid\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; Only appears on a basket with nothing on it. It discards the basket.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eNo basket yet\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; That row shows \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOpen basket\u003c/span\u003e instead \u0026ndash; see the opening guide, right here on the same tab.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eOut of service\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The cavity is Closed or Scrapped in the die\u0027s configuration and cannot hold a basket.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eWHEN THE RELEASE BUTTON TURNS RED\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eYou typed no reading\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The basket closes at the count it already has, and this cavity is credited nothing further \u0026ndash; everything it ran since its last entry is lost. Only do this on a basket you know is already settled.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eUnder the standard fill\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The basket will close below its normal pack quantity. That is allowed; the colour is only telling you it is short.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#3A2E10;border-left:5px solid #F4B343;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;margin:4px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;padding-bottom:4px;\"\u003eIf the reading is refused\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eA reading below what is already recorded for this die this shift is refused, and \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eRelease basket\u003c/span\u003e greys out. First check the number you wrote down. If the counter really was reset, or a wrong number went in earlier, press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eCounter reset / wrong total?\u003c/span\u003e right here in this dialog, declare what the counter actually reads, and the release goes through. Do not go looking for a supervisor \u0026ndash; this is yours to fix.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
                "fontSize": 13,
                "overflow": "auto"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.display.markdown"
          }
